<title>USA: Jacor Communications sells 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Jacor Communications sells 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Jacor Communications Inc was priced on Wednesday via Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette in the 144A private placement market, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Jacor Communications is in the radio broadcast industry.</p>
<p>BORROWER JACOR COMMUNICATIONS INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	   COUPON 8.75 PCT    MATURITY 6/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES   ISS PRICE 100.00   FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2	YIELD 8.75 PCT     PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P SINGLE-B	   SPREAD 220 BPS     CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678</p>
